<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Bewijsrecht, Belanghebbende &amp; Verbintenissenrecht — Meekrab Leermodule</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --meekrab: #9E2A2B;
    --meekrab-dark: #751C1D;
    --meekrab-light: #FDF6F6;
    --brass: #B8860B;
    --brass-light: #E5C158;
    --kleur-achtergrond: #FFFFFF;
    --kleur-perkament: #FCFBF7;
    --kleur-tekst: #1F2421;
    --kleur-grens: #DCDFE0;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: var(--kleur-tekst);
    background: var(--kleur-achtergrond);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  main, footer {
    max-width: 60rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
  }

  header {
    background: var(--meekrab);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 4px solid var(--brass);
  }

  header h1 { margin: 0 0 .35rem; font-size: 1.95rem; }
  header p { margin: 0; opacity: .92; font-style: italic; }

  nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kleur-grens);
    padding: .65rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  nav ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  nav a {
    color: var(--meekrab);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: .9rem;
  }

  nav a:hover, nav a:focus {
    text-decoration: underline;
    color: var(--meekrab-dark);
  }

  section, article { padding: 1.75rem 0 1rem; }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--meekrab);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--meekrab);
    padding-bottom: .3rem;
  }

  h3 { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--meekrab-dark); }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: .95rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  caption {
    caption-side: top;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: .5rem 0;
    color: var(--kleur-tekst);
  }

  th, td {
    border: 1px solid var(--kleur-grens);
    padding: .6rem .75rem;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  thead th {
    background: var(--meekrab);
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
    background: var(--meekrab-light);
  }

  ol.opera {
    counter-reset: opera;
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  ol.opera > li {
    counter-increment: opera;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--kleur-grens);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--meekrab);
    border-radius:
